{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39653","headline":"冬暮山舍喜标上人见访 · 黄滔","name":"冬暮山舍喜标上人见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞三冬杪，深居业尽抛。\n迳松开雪後，砌竹忽僧敲。\n茗汲冰销溜，鑪烧鹊去巢。\n共谈慵僻意，微日下林梢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}